f"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/10 text-[hsl(var(--brand-2))] sm:h-10 sm:w-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-focus h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"></path><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"></path><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"></path><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-mobile-safe block text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-base">模糊 GIF</span><span class="text-mobile-safe mt-1 hidden text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground sm:line-clamp-1">在浏览器本地模糊整张 GIF 或选定区域，可按时间隐藏人脸、文字和其他敏感信息。</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-auto hidden h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5 sm:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="group flex min-h-[4.5rem] min-w-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-background/80 p-3 shadow-sm backdrop-blur transition hover:border-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/40 hover:bg-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 sm:min-h-[5rem] sm:p-4" href="/zh/tools/gif-to-png"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/10 text-[hsl(var(--brand-2))] sm:h-10 sm:w-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-mobile-safe block text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-base">GIF 转 PNG</span><span class="text-mobile-safe mt-1 hidden text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground sm:line-clamp-1">将一个或多个 GIF 的第一帧、全部帧或自定义选取的帧提取为 PNG 图片，文件在浏览器本地处理。</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-auto hidden h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5 sm:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="group flex min-h-[4.5rem] min-w-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-background/80 p-3 shadow-sm backdrop-blur transition hover:border-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/40 hover:bg-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 sm:min-h-[5rem] sm:p-4" href="/zh/tools/gif-to-jpg"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/10 text-[hsl(var(--brand-2))] sm:h-10 sm:w-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-mobile-safe block text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-base">GIF 转 JPG</span><span class="text-mobile-safe mt-1 hidden text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground sm:line-clamp-1">将 GIF 的首帧、全部帧或指定帧导出为 JPG 图片，可设置 JPEG 质量与透明区域背景色。</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-auto hidden h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5 sm:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="group flex min-h-[4.5rem] min-w-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-background/80 p-3 shadow-sm backdrop-blur transition hover:border-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/40 hover:bg-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 sm:min-h-[5rem] sm:p-4" href="/zh/tools/gif-to-lottie"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/10 text-[hsl(var(--brand-2))] sm:h-10 sm:w-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-boxes h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z"></path><path d="m7 16.5-4.74-2.85"></path><path d="m7 16.5 5-3"></path><path d="M7 16.5v5.17"></path><path d="M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z"></path><path d="m17 16.5-5-3"></path><path d="m17 16.5 4.74-2.85"></path><path d="M17 16.5v5.17"></path><path d="M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z"></path><path d="M12 8 7.26 5.15"></path><path d="m12 8 4.74-2.85"></path><path d="M12 13.5V8"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-mobile-safe block text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-base">GIF 转 Lottie</span><span class="text-mobile-safe mt-1 hidden text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground sm:line-clamp-1">在浏览器本地将多个动态 GIF 分别转为 .lottie 动画包和独立 Lottie JSON，保留动画节奏与透明背景。</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right ml-auto hidden h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5 sm:block" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a><a class="group flex min-h-[4.5rem] min-w-0 items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-background/80 p-3 shadow-sm backdrop-blur transition hover:border-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/40 hover:bg-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 sm:min-h-[5rem] sm:p-4" href="/zh/tools/gif-to-apng"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-md bg-[hsl(var(--brand-2))]/10 text-[hsl(var(--brand-2))] sm:h-10 sm:w-10"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-image h-5 w-5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><circle cx="9" cy="9" r="2"></circle><path d="m21 15-3.086-3.086a2 2 0 0 0-2.828 0L6 21"></path></svg></span><span class="min-w-0"><span class="text-mobile-safe block text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-base">GIF 转 APNG</span><span class="text-mobile-safe mt-1 hidden text-xs leading-5 text-muted-foreground sm:line-clamp-1">将一个或多个动态 GIF 转为 APNG 动图，保留动画时间和透明区域，文件在浏览器本地处理。</span></span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide l